  offerLine: Kawakawa, honeydew and berries. It's not easy to get right. Put it on the menu. I'll know if you've cut a corner.
  activeLine: I can wait. I've waited this long.
  readyLine: ...It tastes exactly the same. I was seven, the last time I had this. I'm not crying. It's the kawakawa.
  doneLine: Keep that one on the menu for me, would you?
